'''Moon''' is the 49th stage of [[The Aku Realms]]. It drops a [[Catfruit|Gold Catfruit]] when cleared for the first time, also unlocking an [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)/Invasion|Invasion]] in [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku]]. The boss of this stage is [[High Priest Mamon]], a much stronger version of [[Dark Priest Mamon]]. This is a [[:Category:No Continue Stages|No Continues]] stage.

